---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import PhonePreview from '@/components/PhonePreview.astro'
import SiteHead from '@/components/SiteHead.astro'
import DownloadLinks from '@/components/DownloadLinks.astro'
import { campaignStoreURLs } from '@/lib/campaign-links.mjs'
import appIcon from '@/assets/dee/app-icon.png'
import roundTimer from '@/assets/dee/paid/build33-round-timer.png'
import '@/styles/dee.css'
import '@/styles/solo-workout.css'

const {appStoreURL, googlePlayURL} = campaignStoreURLs({
  token: 'site_solo_workout_20260924',
  source: 'dee_training',
  medium: 'organic_web',
  campaign: 'solo_muay_thai_workout',
})

const rounds = [
  {
    number: '01',
    title: 'Find your feet',
    intent: 'Move without losing your stance.',
    minutes: [
      'Step forward and back in your stance, with your guard up.',
      'Add a light jab as you move. Return your hand to guard.',
      'Jab–cross, then reset your feet before the next combination.',
    ],
  },
  {
    number: '02',
    title: 'Build a combination',
    intent: 'Make the reset part of the work.',
    minutes: [
      'Jab–cross at a controlled pace.',
      'Jab–cross, then step out before repeating.',
      'Repeat the sequence while keeping your balance and guard.',
    ],
  },
  {
    number: '03',
    title: 'Add one Muay Thai tool',
    intent: 'Use a kick or teep only if you have learned it.',
    minutes: [
      'Jab, then a light lead teep; return to stance after each rep.',
      'Jab–cross, then a controlled rear kick; reset before repeating.',
      'Choose one of those combinations and keep it smooth.',
    ],
  },
  {
    number: '04',
    title: 'Put it together',
    intent: 'Finish with clean movement, not speed.',
    minutes: [
      'Repeat your best combination from the earlier rounds.',
      'Add a step or angle after each combination.',
      'Shadowbox freely at an easy pace, returning to balance each time.',
    ],
  },
] as const
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
  <head>
    <SiteHead
      exactTitle="20-Minute Solo Muay Thai Workout (No Bag) | Dee"
      description="A practical 20-minute solo Muay Thai workout: warm up, shadowbox four three-minute rounds, rest, and cool down. No bag needed."
      canonical="/solo-muay-thai-workout/"
    />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/barlow-regular.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/barlow-condensed-black.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
  </head>
  <body class="solo-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to workout</a>
    <header class="guide-header" data-download-header>
      <div class="guide-header__inner">
        <a class="guide-brand" href="/" aria-label="Dee home">
          <Image src={appIcon} alt="" width={42} height={42} loading="eager" />
          <span>DEE</span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Page navigation">
          <a href="#workout">The workout</a>
        </nav>
        <DownloadLinks appStoreURL={appStoreURL} googlePlayURL={googlePlayURL} />
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="guide-hero" aria-labelledby="guide-title">
        <div class="guide-shell guide-hero__grid">
          <div class="guide-hero__copy">
            <p class="guide-kicker"><span class="guide-kicker__line"></span> Solo practice / no bag</p>
            <h1 id="guide-title">A 20-minute solo <em>Muay Thai workout.</em></h1>
            <p class="guide-hero__intro">Four shadowboxing rounds you can do between classes. All you need is clear floor space and a timer.</p>
            <div class="guide-hero__actions">
              <a class="guide-button" href="#workout">Use this workout <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
              <a class="guide-text-link" href="#with-dee">Get Dee <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="guide-hero__product">
            <PhonePreview src={roundTimer} alt="Example Dee in-round screen showing a shadowboxing cue and a running timer" eager />
            <p>Example Dee workout screen. Your plan and drills may differ.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="format" class="guide-setup guide-shell" aria-labelledby="format-title">
        <div>
          <p class="guide-kicker guide-kicker--dark">Before the bell</p>
          <h2 id="format-title">Set up to move.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-setup__copy">
          <p>Clear enough space to step in each direction. Set a timer for <strong>four three-minute rounds</strong> with <strong>one minute of rest</strong> between rounds. Keep the effort controlled so you can focus on balance, guard and clean resets.</p>
          <p>Use techniques you have already practised with a coach. If a teep or kick is new to you, use jab–cross and footwork for round three instead. Pause if you feel pain or cannot keep the movement controlled.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-format" aria-label="20-minute session format">
          <div class="guide-format__total"><span>Session format</span><strong>20 min</strong></div>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Warm-up</dt><dd>03:00</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Work</dt><dd>04 × 03:00</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Rest</dt><dd>03 × 01:00</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Cool-down</dt><dd>02:00</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="workout" class="guide-workout" aria-labelledby="workout-title">
        <div class="guide-shell">
          <div class="guide-section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="guide-kicker guide-kicker--dark">The session / 20:00</p>
              <h2 id="workout-title">Follow the clock.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Each row is one minute. Take a one-minute rest after rounds one, two and three.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="guide-stage guide-stage--warmup">
            <div class="guide-stage__header"><span>00 / Prepare</span><strong>03:00</strong></div>
            <h3>Warm up first</h3>
            <ol>
              <li>Easy stepping or walking, gradually lifting the pace.</li>
              <li>Gentle shoulder and hip movement, then light footwork.</li>
              <li>Light jabs and crosses, returning to guard each time.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="guide-rounds">
            {rounds.map((round, index) => (
              <article class="guide-round" aria-labelledby={`round-${round.number}`}>
                <div class="guide-round__number" aria-hidden="true">{round.number}</div>
                <div class="guide-round__body">
                  <div class="guide-round__top"><span>Round {round.number} / 03:00</span><span>Shadowboxing</span></div>
                  <h3 id={`round-${round.number}`}>{round.title}</h3>
                  <p class="guide-round__intent">{round.intent}</p>
                  <ol class="guide-minute-list">
                    {round.minutes.map((minute, minuteIndex) => (
                      <li><span>Min {minuteIndex + 1}</span><span>{minute}</span></li>
                    ))}
                  </ol>
                  {index < 3 && <p class="guide-rest"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> Rest for 01:00, then start the next round.</p>}
                </div>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="guide-stage guide-stage--cooldown">
            <div class="guide-stage__header"><span>05 / Finish</span><strong>02:00</strong></div>
            <h3>Cool down</h3>
            <p>Walk easily and let your breathing settle. Make a note of which combination felt most balanced; use it as your starting point next time.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="guide-variation">
            <h3>Only have 12 minutes?</h3>
            <p>Warm up for three minutes, do rounds one and two with a minute of rest between them, then cool down for two minutes. Keep the same focus on clean resets.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="with-dee" class="guide-app" aria-labelledby="dee-title">
        <div class="guide-shell guide-app__grid">
          <div class="guide-app__copy">
            <p class="guide-kicker">When you want the next cue spoken</p>
            <h2 id="dee-title">Keep your eyes up.</h2>
            <p>This written session works with any timer. Dee can build a plan around your level, time and equipment, then speak drill and round cues during your workout.</p>
            <p class="guide-app__note">The session above is a standalone guide. Dee may create a different session for you.</p>
            <div class="guide-store-links">
              <a href={appStoreURL} aria-label="Get Dee on the App Store" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/badges/app-store.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" width="144" height="48" /></a>
              <a href={googlePlayURL} aria-label="Get Dee on Google Play" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/badges/google-play.svg" alt="Get it on Google Play" width="162" height="48" /></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="guide-footer">
      <div class="guide-shell guide-footer__inner">
        <p><strong>DEE</strong> · Muay Thai Coach</p>
        <p>Dee is for general sport and fitness. Train within your limits.</p>
        <nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/support/">Support</a></nav>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
